From ce6e813b467da4a8d11cee8792feb6ecf1db519e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 10:44:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/34] WP28: UI bug sweep

Conflict resolution: cache keys in base.html, auth_base.html, public_legal_base.html and guest/base.html. app.css takes WP28's 20261004w; host.css, changed by WP25 and WP28, goes to 20261004x; guest/base.html keeps PR 230's stylesheet list (no guest-ticket.css, which main archived) with guest.css at 20261004w. host.css: kept WP25's house book, signature and report blocks and WP28's signature-block rules. One overflow fix: WP28's shared .panel.tight.scroll-x rule in app.css makes every wide table scroll, so WP25's duplicate .host-workspace .panel.tight.scroll-x rule became .host-workspace .panel.housebook-scroll { position: relative } and its comment names the shared rule; WP25's word-wrap floors for the register stay. reservation_detail.html: the hand-filing panels (WP23) are not in this order yet; WP23's step applies them with WP28's padding fix (class panel, not panel tight).
